.SS "void carr_destroy (\fBCARR\fP * vec)"

.PP
Destroys a vector and releases its internal resources\&. Releases resources owned by the vector implementation and invalidates the vector's internal storage\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIvec\fP Pointer to the vector to destroy\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
This function does not return an error code\&. 

.PP
Whether the structure is reset to a safe, reusable state depends on the implementation\&. 

.PP
The pointed-to elements are not assumed to be freed\&. 
.RE
.PP

